      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِطْعَانٌ</span></b>  One <i>who pierces,</i> or <i>thrusts, the enemy
much;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِطْعَنٌ</span></b> : (K:) pl. of
